summary:
  The line on the cover that names a stand-in is given no words.

history:
  A sleeve that reads "Nüüd taas sajab lund" stood under "Päiksepoolsel
  tänaval" with nothing to say it was another record. The cover carries
  "From another release" or "Artist picture" on its lower edge now. This
  mutant leaves the line on the cover empty.

target:
  package/contents/ui/CoverTouch.qml

find:
          text: touch.note
          room: touch.width - Kirigami.Units.smallSpacing * 3 - touch.corner

replace:
          text: ""
          room: touch.width - Kirigami.Units.smallSpacing * 3 - touch.corner

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_covertouch.qml::test_a_stand_in_says_what_it_is.
  Line-neutral.
